    "text": {
     "en": "Cities are governed by a municipal corporation. The city is divided into wards and each ward elects a councillor.\nThe head of a municipal corporation is the mayor.\nThe corporation looks after roads, street lights, drainage, garbage collection, water supply and public parks."
